<title>FINLAND: ATRIA RIGHTS ISSUE ALMOST FULLY SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>ATRIA RIGHTS ISSUE ALMOST FULLY SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group Atria Oy said in a statement on Friday its rights issue of 4.3 million new A shares had been almost fully subscribed.</p>
<p>&quot;A total of 4,271,882 shares were subscribed for, corresponding to 99.2 percent of the shares offered,&quot; Atria said.</p>
</text>
